			"Message": "docs(Rest): Add inline code formatting to README.md\n\nApply inline code formatting (backticks) to technical terms, technology names, and tool references throughout the Rest component documentation. Changes include formatting `VS Code`, `TypeScript`, `tsc`, `Node.js`, `esbuild`, `Rust`, `OXC`, `CodeEditorLand`, and `VSCode` to improve readability and adhere to documentation standards.\n\nThis ensures consistent visual distinction between technical identifiers and natural language in the README description of the Rust-powered TypeScript compiler.",
