			"Message": "style(Rest): Format bin/Rest.js with double quotes and 4-space indentation\n\nReverse the previous single-quote and 2-space indentation style to match the current project convention used in the Rest CLI wrapper. Update all string literals to use double quotes, reorder imports to the standard pattern, and apply 4-space indentation for the execSync call arguments and object literals.\n\nThese formatting adjustments align bin/Rest.js with the current project style conventions without altering runtime behavior.",
